acted on it. You've now endorsed&nbsp;
McCarthy for Speaker of the House.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:48.080
Why don't I have him running? You know,&nbsp;
I endorsed him in his race, but I haven't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:52.640
endorsed anybody for speaker. So why not consider?
Speaker 1: Now, that's super interesting because,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:56.560
of course, we know from that leaked audio that&nbsp;
came out a few weeks ago that right after the&nbsp;&nbsp;

