00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:44.640
Trump went on to cite a different reason for why&nbsp;
he's upset with Kevin McCarthy. And I found this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.160
one really interesting. Let's take a look at this.
Speaker 4: We have some great warriors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

